6. {"type": "artwork", "properties": {"name": "Golub mira", "tags": ["artwork", "sculpture", "memorial", "national_park", "island"], "description": "A symbolic outdoor sculpture created by Dušan Džamonja and donated to the Brijuni archipelago in memory of Josip Broz Tito. Made of corten and formed from welded iron chains, it was conceived as a powerful expression of peace and freedom, combining modern artistic form with historical remembrance.", "rating": null, "reviews": null}}
